{"id":"3986b1fdb85a0caf","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md","title":"强Kleene跳跃的超限极小构造","display":"thm-kripke-jump-iteration — 强Kleene跳跃的超限极小构造","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration","aliases":["91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration"],"display":"thm-kripke-jump-iteration — 强Kleene跳跃的超限极小构造","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kripke-jump-iteration — 强Kleene跳跃的超限极小构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2afb05d81a538d8a\" href=\"?note=2afb05d81a538d8a\" title=\"91-lem-jump-monotonicity\">91-lem-jump-monotonicity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-kripke-jump-iteration-—-强-Kleene-跳跃的超限极小构造\">thm-kripke-jump-iteration — 强 Kleene 跳跃的超限极小构造</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Info}_c\">\\(\\operatorname{Info}_c\\)</span> (一致句子编码信息集类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\in\\operatorname{Info}_c\">\\(\\varnothing\\in\\operatorname{Info}_c\\)</span>，且每条按包含关系递增的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Info}_c\">\\(\\operatorname{Info}_c\\)</span>-链之并仍属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Info}_c\">\\(\\operatorname{Info}_c\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}:\\operatorname{Info}_c\\to\\operatorname{Info}_c\">\\(J_{\\mathrm{SK}}:\\operatorname{Info}_c\\to\\operatorname{Info}_c\\)</span>\n(强 Kleene 真理跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Info}_c\n(X\\subseteq Y\\to J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(X)\\subseteq J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(Y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Info}_c\n(X\\subseteq Y\\to J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(X)\\subseteq J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(Y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing,\\ \\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma_\\alpha),\\ \\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\">\\(\\Gamma_0=\\varnothing,\\ \\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma_\\alpha),\\ \\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\\)</span> (超限迭代)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span> (极小一致固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\coloneqq\n\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Info}_c:J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(X)=X\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\coloneqq\n\\{X\\in\\operatorname{Info}_c:J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(X)=X\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}jump\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\to\n\\exists\\kappa\\,\n\\left[\n\\forall\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\\Gamma_\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Info}_c\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\,\n(\\Gamma_\\alpha\\subseteq\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1})\n\\land\n\\Gamma_\\kappa\n=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma_\\kappa)\n=\\Gamma_{\\min}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\,\n(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\subseteq\\Delta)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}jump\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\to\n\\exists\\kappa\\,\n\\left[\n\\forall\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\\Gamma_\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Info}_c\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\,\n(\\Gamma_\\alpha\\subseteq\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1})\n\\land\n\\Gamma_\\kappa\n=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma_\\kappa)\n=\\Gamma_{\\min}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\,\n(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\subseteq\\Delta)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极限阶段取之前真、假信息的并；一致性由强 Kleene 跳跃和递增并保持。\n一般必须继续到超限闭包阶段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\omega\">\\(\\Gamma_\\omega\\)</span> 不必已经固定。</p>\n<p>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 只正出现”可用来证明相应条件对信息扩张单调，但不保证每个正公式\n在有限阶段进入，也不保证它在所有固定点中取同一真值。真理陈述者是\n正自指却在极小固定点中保持 gap 的直接反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-kripke-jump-iteration-—-强-Kleene-跳跃的超限极小构造","text":"thm-kripke-jump-iteration — 强 Kleene 跳跃的超限极小构造","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-lem-jump-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"2afb05d81a538d8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","lo